# Canonical Linux Xvfb screen geometry for every Hoolypane desktop E2E, benchmark,
# and packaged-artifact smoke entry point (single source of truth; previously
# hand-synced across six sites).
#
# Consumers:
#   - root package.json "desktop:xvfb" wrapper script (sourced; every *:xvfb pnpm
#     script composes it, and so do the CI workflows and scripts/release-dry-run.mjs)
#   - scripts/e2e-vm.sh (sources HOOLYPANE_XVFB_GEOMETRY as its VM_SCREEN default)
#
# Keep this file POSIX-sh: npm/pnpm scripts source it through /bin/sh.
# Explicit geometry is required: xvfb-run's default 640x480 clamps the Electron
# window below its minimum, shrinking masonry seeds until native drag input hits
# the wrong card (documented phantom-drag failure mode).
HOOLYPANE_XVFB_GEOMETRY="1920x1080x24"
HOOLYPANE_XVFB_SCREEN_ARGS="--server-args=-screen 0 $HOOLYPANE_XVFB_GEOMETRY"
